🏔️ Production-Ready Stitch Prompt — The Haven Cabin Resort

a. PROJECT OVERVIEW
(from raw prompt only)
The Haven is a luxury cabin/resort property website — a single-page, scroll-driven editorial experience. The existing codebase has five core sections: a full-screen hero, a minimalist text intro, a split philosophy layout, a draggable Swiper gallery on a sage-green background, and a dark footer. The goal is to enhance this existing page with:

Elevated visual design lifted from the Johannis hotel reference (typography weight contrast, soft-warm-neutral tones, spacious white-space rhythm, asymmetric image-text splits, icon-row amenity strips).
Full GSAP 3 animation layer: hero text reveal, scroll-triggered fade/slide-ins, horizontal parallax on images, staggered letter or word splitting on headlines, and a smooth navbar morph on scroll.
No new pages — deepen and enrich what exists.


