Typography:

Display / Headings: Serif typeface (Cormorant Garamond or Playfair Display), weight 300–400, size scale: 72px → 56px → 40px → 28px. Extremely wide letter-spacing on uppercase labels (tracking: 0.3–0.5em). Italic variants used for tonal contrast within headlines.
Body / Labels: Sans-serif (Inter or DM Sans), weight 300 (light), size 12–14px, letter-spacing 0.2em, uppercase for all nav and label items.
Section Index Labels: Single roman numeral I, II, III inside a 1px bordered box — tiny text 0.55rem, tracking 0.35em. Centered, used as visual chapter markers.

Spacing & Layout:

Generous vertical padding: 120px top/bottom on all sections (desktop), 64px mobile.
Max content width: 1280px, centered.
Image-text splits: 55% image / 45% text, or 45% / 55% alternating per section. Images always bleed to section edge, no rounded corners, no shadows.
Thin 1px horizontal rules in #E8E2D8 between sections.
Micro-spacing: 32px gap between label → headline → body → CTA within a text block.

Component Styles:

Navbar: Transparent on hero, morphs to rgba(245,240,232,0.97) with backdrop-filter: blur(12px) and border-bottom: 1px solid #E8E2D8 on scroll. Logo centered, links flanking left/right. Text switches from white → #2B2417 on scroll.
CTA Buttons: Two styles: (1) pill-shaped outlined border: 1px solid #2B2417, border-radius: 50px, padding: 14px 40px, hover fills #2B2417 with white text — smooth 400ms transition; (2) rectangular outlined border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5) for hero overlay.
Amenity Icon Strip: Row of 3–4 thin-line icons with a short label below each, centered, 1px dividers between, background #F5F0E8, padding 48px 0. Icons are stroke-only, 24x24px.
Gallery Cards (Room Cards): Full-bleed image top, minimal text below — suite name in serif 18px, spec line in sans 11px #8C7B5E, price in serif 16px. No card border, no shadow. Cards sit on #F5F0E8 background.

Animation / Interaction Feel:

Slow, deliberate. Nothing snappy. Eases are power2.out or expo.out.
Images have a subtle scale-up parallax on scroll (scale: 1.05 → 1.0 as they enter viewport).
Text lines reveal with a clip-path mask: clipPath: "inset(0 100% 0 0)" → "inset(0 0% 0 0)".
Navbar logo fades in on load with y: -20 → 0, opacity: 0 → 1, duration 1.2s.
Section divider lines draw in from left: scaleX: 0 → 1, transformOrigin: left.
Hover on image blocks: very slow scale(1.03) zoom, transition: 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94).
Overall mood: warm editorial luxury — think Kinfolk magazine meets Alpine hotel brochure. Generous breathing room. Never rushed.


